From 0000000000000000000000000000000000000000 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
Date: Fri, 4 Sep 2026 12:00:00 +0530
Subject: [PATCH 10/10] power: supply: qcom_smbx: harden SMB5 charging policy

Expose charge_behaviour so userspace can inhibit battery charging while
leaving USB input online. Correct SMB5 over-voltage/status/ICL decoding
and input voltage scaling, make CURRENT_MAX and STATUS read-only, and
revalidate TCPM fallback limits through notifications and periodic work.

Also keep charger-side voltage/current telemetry available while charging
is inhibited and use the SMB5 twelve-second AICL rerun interval.

Signed-off-by: OpenAI Codex <codex@openai.com>
---
 drivers/power/supply/qcom_smbx.c | 190 +++++++++++++++++++++++++------
 1 file changed, 154 insertions(+), 36 deletions(-)

